{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32583","headline":"秋日望西阳 · 刘沧","name":"秋日望西阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古木苍苔坠几层，行人一望旅情增。\n太行山下黄河水，铜雀台西武帝陵。\n风入蒹葭秋色动，雨余杨柳暮烟凝。\n野花似泣红妆泪，寒露满枝枝不胜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32583.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32583","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}